      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 3.95,
          "en": "So now we have two options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.97,
          "end": 7.34,
          "en": "We could set up a subscription here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.36,
          "end": 12.7,
          "en": "Subscribing automatically in the markup with this dollar sign trick won't help us because we don't need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.7,
          "end": 13.72,
          "en": "all products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.72,
          "end": 15.79,
          "en": "So I can subscribe here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.03,
          "end": 22.69,
          "en": "I get my products here, my products array, and I can store this in a variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.82,
          "end": 32.72,
          "en": "Fetched product or whatever you want to name it, and simply set fetched products here equal to prods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.46,
          "end": 36.79,
          "en": "And also unsubscribe and ondestroy, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.81,
          "end": 39.21,
          "en": "Which I haven't done here yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.22,
          "end": 40.3,
          "en": "You, of course, should do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.3,
          "end": 42.1,
          "en": "But let's assume that I did.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.1,
          "end": 48.55,
          "en": "Now I have my fetch products and then here, when I need the description, I can simply add a new description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 50.47,
          "end": 53.95,
          "en": "Variable, which is not available as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.06,
          "end": 56.86,
          "en": "In case I fail to fetch one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.86,
          "end": 61.48,
          "en": "And then here I want to set the description by finding the product here in my fetch product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.48,
          "end": 65.53,
          "en": "So I will set description equal to fetch products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.53,
          "end": 66.46,
          "en": "Find.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.73,
          "end": 74.96000000000001,
          "en": "P where the ID of the product I'm looking at here in this function is equal to the ID of my cart item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 74.96000000000001,
          "end": 81.65,
          "en": "Now please note that in my dummy cart data here I have a couple of IDs which are not met in the product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 81.65,
          "end": 82.19,
          "en": "store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 82.19,
          "end": 85.7,
          "en": "So if I try to view the description for those, we would get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 86.22,
          "end": 87.99,
          "en": "You could of course handle this error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 87.99,
          "end": 90.51,
          "en": "But for the purpose of this demo, it doesn't really matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 90.51,
          "end": 93.43,
          "en": "Let's focus on the items for which we have a description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 93.45,
          "end": 98.86,
          "en": "So here I should be able to fetch the whole product and there I can then access the description property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "Then the description here should be set and therefore outputting the description down there instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 105.84,
          "en": "of not available should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 106.78,
          "end": 108.58,
          "en": "And I'm getting an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 108.61,
          "end": 111.61,
          "en": "This should be imported from svelte store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 111.64,
          "end": 116.14,
          "en": "It also works if you import it from just svelte, but it can't be optimized by svelte, so you should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 116.14,
          "end": 117.91,
          "en": "import it from slash store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 118.78999999999999,
          "end": 120.2,
          "en": "But back to this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 120.2,
          "end": 121.43,
          "en": "I'm outputting the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.43,
          "end": 123.89,
          "en": "Let's see if it works again for these two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 123.92,
          "end": 126.14,
          "en": "It won't work because we have no matching products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 126.14,
          "end": 129.59,
          "en": "But if I add the book and I click show description, I see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 129.74,
          "end": 131.54,
          "en": "So that is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 131.54,
          "end": 132.77,
          "en": "But it has a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.77,
          "end": 136.57999999999998,
          "en": "This approach has a problem and it's not the missing unsubscribe call.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.61,
          "end": 137.84,
          "en": "Of course you should do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.84,
          "end": 142.04,
          "en": "But the bigger problem is that I always fetch all products here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "And I store this in a variable here, and I always have that variable around, even if I don't need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 148.23,
          "en": "the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 152.44,
          "en": "Now you can do that, but I prefer a different approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.49,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "So what you could do as well is here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.94,
          "end": 163.05,
          "en": "You could go into the function where you need your data, then reach out to the product store and subscribe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 163.05,
          "end": 163.68,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.43,
          "end": 170.46,
          "en": "And there you then still get all your prods and now set description equal to prods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 170.49,
          "end": 173.46,
          "en": "Find basically the same logic we had up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 173.46,
          "end": 176.52,
          "en": "But now we're only doing this just in time when we need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 176.73,
          "end": 181.14,
          "en": "And now this, of course, still gives us a unsubscribe function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 183.9,
          "en": "We can simply call that right thereafter once we're done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.9,
          "end": 185.4,
          "en": "Once we fetch our data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 186.49,
          "end": 187.99,
          "en": "Now if I save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 192.54,
          "en": "And I add my book here and now I show the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.57,
          "end": 196.62,
          "en": "This works as before, but now we're just fetching this one time now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.65,
          "end": 199.74,
          "en": "Technically, we're still getting all the products from the store here, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.74,
          "end": 201.27,
          "en": "And then we're finding the one product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.27,
          "end": 205.16,
          "en": "But at least we're not constantly keeping all the data around in a variable here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.17000000000002,
          "end": 208.68,
          "en": "Now, in the end, it's always up to you which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.71,
          "end": 211.8,
          "en": "I just wanted to give you this idea here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 215.79,
          "en": "In cases where you only need a data one time, you can immediately unsubscribe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 215.79,
          "end": 220.26,
          "en": "You don't need that ongoing subscription which persists in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.26,
          "end": 226.05,
          "en": "If you only need data one time, you can get it with this trick or with this approach here, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
